course: dictionary
lesson: 11698
title: Formal words: attest
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Attest is a formal word. It means to show or prove that something is true. When you see «attest to», look at the words after it: they tell you what the proof is.
explain: «The muddy boots attest to a long walk in the rain.» The boots are the proof. You can see the mud, so you know the walk happened. Attest does not mean boots or walk. It means the boots show the walk is true.
explain: In law, a witness can attest by signing a paper to say something is true. «Mrs Hall signed the form to attest that the card was hers.» Her signature is her promise that the card is hers.
fact: Attest is a verb: attest, attests, attested, attesting.
fact: «Attest» means to show or prove that something is true.
fact: «Attest» is often followed by «to», as in «attest to her skill».
fact: In law, a witness can attest by signing a document to say it is true.
fact: Attest is a formal word, so look for it in law, history and exam texts. Check your meaning by swapping in «prove» or «show is true» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «The photos attest that the flood reached the top of the wall.» What does attest mean here? | Forget completely | Wash away | Hide from view | *Show or prove that it is true
exercise: «Two teachers can attest that Sam was in class all morning.» What is the job of the teachers' words here? | To ask Sam a question | *To prove that Sam was in class | To sing a song about school | To make Sam feel sad
exercise: Which word means to state that something is true, like a witness signing a paper? | Attack | *Attest | Attach | Attire
test: «The old coins attest to a busy trade in the town long ago.» Which phrase is closest in meaning to attest to? | *Are proof of | Are cleaned for | Are lost in | Are sold to
test: Which sentence uses attest correctly? | The scar attests the sun is hot. | The scar attesting is lunch. | *The scar attests to a fall at the park. | The scar attest a green bicycle.
exam: Read this: «The signed letter attests that the school trip was approved.» What does attests mean? | Makes it longer | Tears up | Asks a question about | *Shows that it is true
